# mem3 OUTPUT: what your part must produce

## 1. BRONZE: `bronze/news` and `bronze/ticks` (read by the Silver jobs, mem2 and you)
Raw, untouched, append-only; format `storage.table_format`; columns `kafka_key, raw_json, topic, partition, offset, kafka_ts`:
```text
bronze/ticks
kafka_key  raw_json                                                      topic         partition offset kafka_ts
RELIANCE   {"ticker":"RELIANCE","price":1425.30,...,"emitted_at":"...100Z"} market-ticks  1         88210  2026-11-09 04:45:00.314
```
Rules: no parsing, no cleaning, **no ticker extraction** (for ticks the ticker is the Kafka key; for news tickers are found in Silver). Row count must equal the Kafka message count.

## 2. SILVER news: `silver/news` (one row per article)
```text
article_id             published_at          source                  headline                                    clean_text (shortened)                       tickers       p_pos p_neg p_neu sentiment_score sentiment_label processed_at
NEWS-a1b2c3d4e5f60001  2026-11-09T04:45:00Z  Economic Times Markets  Reliance Industries Q2 profit beats...      Reliance Industries Q2 profit beats ... RIL...  [RELIANCE]    0.90  0.03  0.07  0.87            positive        2026-11-09T04:45:25Z
NEWS-a1b2c3d4e5f60003  2026-11-09T04:50:00Z  Livemint Markets        SBI and HDFC Bank lead banking rally...     SBI and HDFC Bank lead ... State Bank of ... [SBIN,HDFCBANK] 0.80  0.05  0.15  0.75            positive        2026-11-09T04:50:30Z
```
(also `ingested_at`). `clean_text` has no HTML. `sentiment_score = p_pos - p_neg`; probabilities sum to about 1.

## 3. SILVER news by ticker: `silver/news_by_ticker` (read by mem4)
One row per article x ticker (an article with 2 tickers gives 2 rows):
```text
article_id             ticker    published_at          source            headline                       p_pos p_neg p_neu sentiment_score sentiment_label processed_at
NEWS-a1b2c3d4e5f60001  RELIANCE  2026-11-09T04:45:00Z  Economic Times... Reliance Industries Q2 profit..  0.90  0.03  0.07  0.87            positive        2026-11-09T04:45:25Z
NEWS-a1b2c3d4e5f60003  SBIN      2026-11-09T04:50:00Z  Livemint Markets  SBI and HDFC Bank lead...        0.80  0.05  0.15  0.75            positive        2026-11-09T04:50:30Z
NEWS-a1b2c3d4e5f60003  HDFCBANK  2026-11-09T04:50:00Z  Livemint Markets  SBI and HDFC Bank lead...        0.80  0.05  0.15  0.75            positive        2026-11-09T04:50:30Z
```
Articles that mention none of the 10 tickers stay only in `silver/news`. No duplicate `article_id` (dedupe, restart-safe). Rejected records go to a dead-letter folder.

