`input_count = processed_count + rejected_count` is checked by `verify_pipeline.py`. Same job rows for `bronze_news_sink`, `bronze_ticks_sink`.

## How to verify your output
`python scripts/peek.py bronze/news` · `python scripts/peek.py silver/news_by_ticker` · `python scripts/check_flow.py` (Bronze rows = Kafka offsets) · `python scripts/verify_pipeline.py` (lineage: every Silver article exists in Bronze; sentiment maths; no duplicates).
